cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "vox-type"
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.

type: software
authors:
  - name: starmcainiao
description: >-
  Pre-cast voice asset layer + duplex behaviour controller for voice agents.
  Pre-bakes the process-determined portion of a voice agent's dialogue into
  audited, versioned audio assets and plays them on a hit. On a miss the plan
  aborts by default (fail-closed, rc=5, no audio written); degrading to the
  host's own slow-path TTS requires an explicit --allow-fallback and is traced
  in full.
  A drop-in overlay for the voice stack: sits between the LLM and TTS in a
  cascaded chain, or bypasses a whole turn for an end-to-end S2S model.
  Zero third-party dependencies (Python >= 3.12 standard library only).
date-created: 2026-09-21
date-released: 2026-09-28
url: "https://github.com/starmcainiao/vox-type"
repository-code: "https://github.com/starmcainiao/vox-type"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - speech-to-text
  - text-to-speech
  - voice agent
  - precast voice assets
  - IVR
  - fail-closed
  - voice assistant
  - zero-dependency
  - voice pipeline
  - duplex speech
version: "0.2.0"
